<title>POLAND: KOMUNALNY MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KOMUNALNY MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.49 vs    0.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.90 vs    0.98</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  1.66 vs    1.16</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 3.70 vs    2.72</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.18 vs    3.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    4.99 vs    4.15</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  8.28 vs    4.97</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	18.31 vs   12.32</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Komunalny SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
